00:49:11.200 --> 00:49:11.980
Exactly.

1038
00:49:12.420 --> 00:49:12.920
I know.

1039
00:49:13.060 --> 00:49:16.920
We're both two gals from theater schools in Missouri who landed on the office.

1040
00:49:17.140 --> 00:49:17.580
Go Mo.

